      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is intended and forwardedNumber in DriverCall should not be an array.\nBecause there is difference for the number of available forwarded number between IMS and CS.\n- IMS : Supports multi forwarded numbers.\n- CS : Supports only a forwarded number. (see 3GPP TS24.008, 10.5.4.21b)\n\nTherefore, mForwardedNumber should be array variable for IMS, and this convert logic is needed for CS.",
